│ patch_name               │ server_tree_local_refine                                                                  │
│ patch_description        │ This proposal crosses over the two prior implementations by keeping the efficient         │
│                          │ server-rooted precomputation from the current program while reintroducing the simpler,    │
│                          │ more stable routing bias of the earlier version.                                          │
│                          │                                                                                           │
│                          │ Key ideas:                                                                                │
│                          │ - Precompute one shortest-path tree per server, reducing repeated source-server searches. │
│                          │ - Store transmission latency, routing energy, and hop count for every server-to-node      │
│                          │ route.                                                                                    │
│                          │ - Use a blended assignment score that directly models:                                    │
│                          │   - transmission latency,                                                                 │
│                          │   - routing energy,                                                                       │
│                          │   - queueing pressure from projected server utilization,                                  │
│                          │   - server compute energy.                                                                │
│                          │ - Keep the greedy load-aware assignment, but improve it with a lightweight local          │
│                          │ refinement pass that can reassign sources after the first allocation if the approximate   │
│                          │ global objective improves.                                                                │
│                          │ - Always reconstruct valid simple paths from the server trees.                            │
│                          │                                                                                           │
│                          │ This combines the efficiency of the current program with the stronger assignment          │
│                          │ simplicity of the earlier one, while adding a cheap second-stage improvement step that    │
│                          │ often lowers both latency and energy.                                                     │
