│ patch_type               │ diff                                                                                      │
│ patch_name               │ activation_aware_scoring_and_tree_diversity                                               │
│ patch_description        │ This edit makes two targeted improvements:                                                │
│                          │                                                                                           │
│                          │ 1) **Increase path candidate diversity per server** by adding a 4th server-rooted         │
│                          │ shortest-path tree with a stronger capacity/congestion-aware blend. This preserves the    │
│                          │ fast precompute pattern while giving the assignment stage more robust alternatives in     │
│                          │ graphs where hop latency and edge energy trade off differently under capacity             │
│                          │ constraints.                                                                              │
│                          │                                                                                           │
│                          │ 2) **Make idle-power scoring activation-aware instead of per-task additive**. The         │
│                          │ previous scoring charged idle cost for every assigned source, which can distort energy    │
│                          │ optimization. Idle power is a server-level fixed cost, so this update charges it mainly   │
│                          │ when a server is newly activated (and mirrors this in local search), improving both       │
│                          │ latency-energy balance and assignment stability.                                          │
│                          │                                                                                           │
│                          │ Additionally, a small tie-break fix in regret ordering prioritizes harder-to-place        │
│                          │ sources when regrets are equal.                                                           │
