│ patch_description        │ This version cross-breeds the stronger parts of both implementations:                     │
│                          │                                                                                           │
│                          │ - **Server-rooted multi-mode Dijkstra candidate generation** (efficient for few servers,  │
│                          │ many sources).                                                                            │
│                          │ - Uses **5 path modes** (latency, balanced, energy, strong-energy, capacity-aware) to     │
│                          │ improve path diversity and avoid poor-capacity links.                                     │
│                          │ - Keeps only the **best candidate per (source, server)** using a baseline that includes   │
│                          │ routing + light compute proxy.                                                            │
│                          │ - Uses a **marginal queue-aware scoring** (M/M/1-inspired delta) for assignment, with:    │
│                          │   - overload protection near a utilization limit,                                         │
│                          │   - routing latency/energy terms,                                                         │
│                          │   - dynamic compute energy term,                                                          │
│                          │   - activation-aware idle cost (higher first-use penalty).                                │
│                          │ - Uses **regret-based construction** (assign hard-to-place sources first).                │
│                          │ - Adds **local relocation refinement** passes to reduce objective further after initial   │
│                          │ assignment.                                                                               │
│                          │ - Preserves I/O contract: returns `{source: {"server": ..., "path": [...]}}` with valid   │
│                          │ simple paths when reachable.                                                              │
│                          │                                                                                           │
│                          │ I also reduced repeated lookup overhead with lightweight precomputed source/server        │
│                          │ parameter maps and kept robust fallback behavior for validity.                            │
